<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666"><br></font></span></h1><h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666">Get Started Today!</font></span></h1>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Whether your business needs working capital or financing for
equipment, National Funding is here to help. As you know from our conversation,
unlike many other lenders, National Funding has a variety of financing
solutions tailored to meet the needs of nearly any type of business. Financing
from National Funding means:</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></font></p><ul><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Loans up to $500,000</font></p></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="text-indent: -0.25in;">Equipment Leasing and Financing up to $100,000</span></font></p></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p><span style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Cash Advances up to $250,000</font></span></p></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p><span style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Variety of Merchant Services, including Credit Card Processing</font></span></p></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p><span style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Funds in your account as soon as the next business day</font></span></p></li><li><p><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in;">Dedicated service from your personcal Account Executive,&nbsp;</span>{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</font></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal">Whether you have a planned need for your business or an
emergency that requires immediate financial assistance National Funding is here
to help. Give me a call or send me an email whenever you’re ready to complete
your application.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Here to help whenever you need!</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">National Funding</strong><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt;"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif">If you no longer wish to receive emails from&nbsp;National Funding, send an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:emailreply@nationalfunding.com">emailreply@nationalfunding.com</a>&nbsp;with Unsubscribe in the subject line. You may also unsubscribe by sending written notice to:&nbsp;National Funding&nbsp;Unsubscribe<br>&nbsp;9530 Towne Centre Dr., Suite 120, San Diego, CA 92121. Thank you.&nbsp;<br>National Funding&nbsp;</font></font></font></span></font></font></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">respects your privacy. Our commitment to your privacy is described in our Privacy Policy which is available on our Web site for your reference.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">© 2018 National Funding. &nbsp;All Rights Reserved.&nbsp;</span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>